<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Installation Complete · ChurchOS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.1"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 to-blue-600 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">
<div class="w-full max-w-md">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-green-600 text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">ChurchOS installed!</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6">Your church management system is ready. Sign in with the administrator account you created.</p>
        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-colors">
            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Sign in now
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-6">Remove or disable the <code>/install</code> route after signing in for security.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-center text-xs text-white/50 mt-4">ChurchOS P Edition · Mwamiri Computers Ltd</p>
</div>
